  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Based on maui 10.0.15.3\n\nChanges since 10.0.14\nBump to 10.0.15.3 with release notes\nMerge pull request #114 from budcribar/fix/anycpu-packages\nEmit AnyCPU IL for source generators and NuGet library packages\nMerge pull request #113 from budcribar/security/remaining-review-fixes\nRelay: keep a waiting session entry until its last waiter leaves\nHarden relay against remaining security review findings (F1, F5, F6, F8, F9)\nMerge pull request #112 from budcribar/claude/project-thread-l4oiwa\nRelay: the admin site's service ticket may use the metrics calls\nRelay: pass scheduled metrics from agents to Admin\nMerge pull request #111 from budcribar/claude/project-thread-w37cul\nMerge pull request #110 from budcribar/claude/project-thread-dzkzt6\nGive control of agent-started sessions to the user who asked for them\nRelay: gRPC error details only in Development, add HSTS\nMerge pull request #109 from budcribar/claude/project-thread-pm2nrz\nMerge pull request #107 from budcribar/agent-tokens-and-ticket-headers\nAccept a newly issued agent token over the remembered one\nAdd per-agent token binding, ticket role claims, and header/cookie-only ticket reading\nMerge pull request #105 from budcribar/claude/project-thread-9is2oo\nMerge remote-tracking branch 'origin/net10' into claude/project-thread-9is2oo\nMerge pull request #106 from budcribar/claude/project-thread-q0tq2b\nMerge pull request #104 from budcribar/claude/project-thread-bf73xe\nApply session sign-in rules to the relay's gRPC calls\nRelay: list clients and groups for the signed-in caller\nRequire a configured RelayTicket signing key of at least 32 bytes\nMerge pull request #103 from budcribar/claude/project-thread-24nqqb\nRefuse RPCD updates without an admin key and carry the installer log\nMerge pull request #102 from budcribar/cursor/forward-update-rpcd-a474\nForward remote RPCD updates from Admin to the fleet agent\nMerge pull request #100 from budcribar/claude/project-thread-ghzw1f\nMerge pull request #101 from budcribar/claude/project-thread-izqv9b\nLog why the relay refused an agent's enrollment key\nPhotino: fire ReadyToConnect only after WebView2 has started\nCI: give manual and release runs a concurrency group of their own\nWindows tests: warm up every tutorial build, not only Photino\nWindows tests: warm up all three Photino tutorial builds\nTests: wait for the WebView2 page after the DevTools connect\nWindows tests: warm up Chrome before the EndToEnd suite\nWindows tests: warm up the shards' first browser and WebView2 starts\nWindows tests: run the desktop tests as parallel shards\nMerge pull request #99 from budcribar/claude/project-thread-kfekiw\nPass the PC's boot time from the agent to Admin\nMerge pull request #98 from budcribar/claude/project-thread-xv5i5s\nRefuse GetIds on a relay that requires sign-in\nMerge pull request #97 from budcribar/claude/project-thread-89es12\nMirror: wait for the WebView before showing the mirror on connect\nTests: say which session is short when the relay's file totals don't match\nMerge pull request #96 from budcribar/claude/project-thread-89es12\nBump to 10.0.15.2 with release notes\nMerge pull request #90 from budcribar/claude/project-thread-i544zb\nMerge pull request #91 from budcribar/claude/project-thread-89es12\nMerge pull request #94 from budcribar/claude/project-thread-wg41g7\nSet-RailwayAgentKeys: create its link folder under -WhatIf too\nMerge pull request #95 from budcribar/claude/project-thread-mj8jra\nSet-RailwayAgentKeys: define a function when dot-sourced, link the relay project itself\nRelay: send non-owner browsers in shared sessions to the mirror, log page requests\nRelay: an EndSession is an expected disconnect, and keeps the requester label\nAdd scripts/Set-RailwayAgentKeys.ps1 to set the relay's enrollment keys on Railway\nAgentHub: add ReleaseAvailableCommand broadcast and AgentAdmin.PublishRelease RPC\n\nFull list: https://github.com/budcribar/RemoteBlazorWebView/compare/10.0.14...b5756b88971ab46b06600ec3edf9d95d074ff078",
